//- 3:30 THE CLIFFHANGER, then 3:50 THE VOTE. The yes path (section#good) is the next slide, so a clicker's next takes it. No, or X, jumps to section#heel at the end of the deck.

//- A beautiful photo, flatly denied, like the rainbow.
section.over-media(data-background-image="img/lavender.jpg" data-background-position="center bottom" data-timing="20")
  h2 Purple isn't real.
  cite.credit Photo: Wilfredor
  aside.notes
    ul
      li Evidence, and the strongest yet: your brain invents a color that no light has.
      li Say it: violet is real. Purple isn't.
      li Stop before saying why. That's the cliffhanger.

section.statement.vote(data-timing="10")
  h2 Does democracy work?
  p.answers
    a(href="#/good") Yes
    a(href="#/heel") No
  aside.notes
    ul
      li Hold here for the vote.
      li Thumbs-up: Yes, or just next.
      li Thumbs-down: No, or X.
